Some Thoughts on Honour        NannyMUD Times                        Page 10
by Hisashi

  Some thoughts on honour.
  
  Greetings.
  Honour is a subject that is very dear to me.
  Tha basic tenents of living honourably is:
  I shall not lie.
  I shall not steal.
  I shall not cheat.
  
  These are the simple rules to follow, but there are an ininity
  infinity of subtleties and addendums.
  
  As a knight, I strive to maintain honour.
  I do not killsteal; I do my duty towards my guild and to my friends
  and allies.
  
  It is not an easy path, taking the low road is often much faster,
  easier, more efficient.
  
  Understanding honour takes a lifetime of contemplation
  and questioning ones views, motives and reasoning.
  
  Ultimately it is worth it.
  To see, to know, to do what is right.
  To judge fairly and to seek justice.
  That is the way of honour.
